# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Served from the root of the deployed directory (site/).
#
# /flavors-roaring is an older address of the roaring page, and links to it are still out there. Without this
# rule it would fall through to the home page — a soft 404, where a reader gets a 200 and the wrong page rather
# than being sent anywhere. 301, so search engines fold it into the canonical /flavors/roaring instead of
# treating the two as separate pages with the same content.
/flavors-roaring  /flavors/roaring  301
